{"schemaVersion":1,"sourceRecord":{"schemaVersion":1,"recordId":"wikibooks-369627-r4498603","sourceId":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa","sourceTitle":"Cookbook:Mushroom Ketchup","sourcePageId":369627,"sourceRevision":"4498603","sourceRevisionTimestamp":"2025-06-04T19:10:55Z","sourceRevisionUser":"Kittycataclysm","sourceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/w/index.php?title=Cookbook:Mushroom%20Ketchup&oldid=4498603","retrievedAt":"2026-10-13T13:09:24.376Z","sourceCategories":["Category:Easy recipes","Category:Recipes","Category:Recipes for ketchup","Category:Recipes using allspice","Category:Recipes using cayenne","Category:Recipes using clove","Category:Recipes using horseradish","Category:Recipes using lemon zest","Category:Recipes using mushroom","Category:Recipes using onion","Category:Recipes using vinegar","Category:Recipes without cooking time","Category:Recipes without servings"],"license":{"id":"wikibooks-cookbook-cc-by-sa-4.0","name":"Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0); Wikibooks text is generally dual-licensed with GFDL unless otherwise noted","evidenceUrl":"https://en.wikibooks.org/wiki/Wikibooks:Copyrights","policyStatus":"verified-license","pageExceptionStatus":"not-reviewed-per-page","attribution":"Attribute Wikibooks contributors by linking each version-specific source page. Indicate that structured fields are extracted and any translated or edited text is modified. Include CC BY-SA 4.0 notice/link and share adaptations under CC BY-SA 4.0 or later.","changeNoticeRequired":true,"shareAlikeRequired":true},"sourceSha256":"4db044019a0e94e2226ae2d37fc92e51917072b0e97b76bc7bfdc639cae60265","sourceWikitext":"{{Recipe summary\n| Category = Condiment recipes\n| Difficulty = 2\n}}\n\n{{Recipe}}\n\n'''Mushroom ketchup''' is a seasoning.\n\n== Ingredients ==\n\n* 2 [[Cookbook:Pound|lbs]] edible [[Cookbook:Mushroom|mushrooms]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 3 [[Cookbook:Tablespoon|tbsp]] [[Cookbook:Salt|salt]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Onion|onion]], [[Cookbook:Chopping|chopped]]\n* 2 tbsp finely ground fresh [[Cookbook:Horseradish|horseradish]]\n* 1 tbsp [[Cookbook:Lemon|lemon]] [[Cookbook:Zest|zest]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|tsp]] [[Cookbook:Clove|cloves]]\n* ½ tsp [[Cookbook:Allspice|allspice]]\n* ¼ [[Cookbook:Cup|cup]] cider [[Cookbook:Vinegar|vinegar]]\n* 1 [[Cookbook:Pinch|pinch]] of ground [[Cookbook:Cayenne Pepper|cayenne]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n\n# Combine the mushrooms and salt. Stir, smash well, and let rest 10 minutes.\n# Transfer mushrooms to a non-metal container, such as a ceramic crock. Cover and let sit overnight.\n# Combine the mushrooms, onion, horseradish, lemon zest, cloves, allspice, vinegar, and cayenne. Bring to a [[Cookbook:Simmering|simmer]] and cook for 15 minutes.\n# Drape a clean cloth over a bowl. Pour the mixture over the cloth, and squeeze to extract all the liquid. The liquid is the mushroom ketchup.\n\n== Notes, tips, and variations ==\n\n* One may sprinkle leftover mushroom solids over food as a spice.\n\n[[Category:Recipes using lemon zest]]\n[[Category:Recipes using mushroom]]\n[[Category:Recipes using onion]]\n[[Category:Recipes using clove]]\n[[Category:Recipes using horseradish]]\n[[Category:Recipes using allspice]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vinegar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using cayenne]]\n[[Category:Recipes for ketchup]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Mushroom Ketchup","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":null,"ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"2 lbs edible mushrooms, chopped","sourceText":"2 lbs edible mushrooms, chopped","amountText":"2 lbs edible mushrooms, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"3 tbsp salt","sourceText":"3 tbsp salt","amountText":"3 tbsp salt","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"1 onion, chopped","sourceText":"1 onion, chopped","amountText":"1 onion, chopped","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"